  Owner       Played by Jon Attree in JNext through the real loader,
              2026-11-03

  Replay      IDENTICAL on 4 recordings, 33534 frames, default colours:
              original and patched machines in lockstep, hook instructions
              uncounted, whole 128K compared each frame apart from the screen
              pixels and the draw buffers built from them; sprite layer and
              ULA against an independent model at 3625 stable frames,
              including the Bridge's seated crew as sprite tiles (5 Bridge
              builds, 512 crew checks); 25,064 hook exits with registers
              checked; 18 of 18 negatives detected, the 3 crew negatives on a
              recording that reaches the Bridge; unit tests pass including a
