  Emulator    JNext 1.1.104: plain and sprites reach play headless, the Knight
              walking past the Bridge's crew in front of them, the other
              rooms' frames unchanged from the previous build; command window,
              game over and return to the title viewed on the previous build;
              real loader from the Browser on a copy of the test card, MD5
              exact, default and with cheats 1+2, play frames viewed

  Coverage    all 48 rooms entered by poked room change, with all objects and
